{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月24日，據《紐約時報》報道，英偉達董事會曾表示，黃仁勳不會復職，但現在又突然改變了決定。<strong>企業治理專家指出，特朗普實際上凌駕於英偉達董事會之上，推翻了董事會的決定，把董事會「架空」。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587784.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T03:23:52.371040+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":99,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T03:00:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T03:17:13.071699+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T03:17:13.071699+00:00","content_hash":"4384836cad5f3999af15c3e58070939f8b5f6fec5bff157e42f453ff86f250eb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}